OL,3,GNEWSALittle finger weightlifter still
OL,4,Apumping iron at 80
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn man who once attempted to break
OL,7,Frecords by lifting weights with his
OL,8,Flittle finger has told how pumping iron
OL,9,Fduring advert breaks in television
OL,10,Fprogrammes has helped him continue to
OL,11,Fstay fit at the age of 80.
OL,13,FHarry Kay, from Preesall, Lancashire,
OL,14,Fstarted lifting when he was 15 and said
OL,15,Fthe first time he heard iron plates
OL,16,Fclanging together sparked a lifelong
OL,17,Fpassion.
OL,19,FIn the 1980s, he caught the attention
OL,20,Fof the BBC and Guinness World Records
OL,21,Fwith his ability to lift 56lb (25kg)
OL,22,Fusing his little finger 21 times.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
